    "publication_date": "2025-12-11",
    "description": "<p>This repository contains the Glacial Lake Position Reasoning (GLake-Pos) dataset, which generates diverse and spatially grounded question&ndash;answer pairs for glacial lake segmentation, used in our study <em>&lsquo;GLACIA: Instance&ndash;Aware Positional Reasoning for Glacial Lake Segmentation via a Multimodal Large Language Model&rsquo; by Lalit Maurya, Saurabh Kaushik, and Beth Tellman</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Please Cite:</p>\n<p>Maurya, Lalit, Saurabh Kaushik, and Beth Tellman. \"GLACIA: Instance-Aware Positional Reasoning for Glacial Lake Segmentation via Multimodal Large Language Model.\"&nbsp;<em>arXiv preprint arXiv:2512.09251</em> (2025).</p>",
